
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Dawit Girma Buayu | Academic Portfolio</title>

  <meta name="description" content="Academic portfolio of Dawit Girma Buayu, Lecturer and Researcher in Water Resources Engineering at Wolkite University, Ethiopia.">

  <style>
    :root {
      --navy: #123047;
      --blue: #176b87;
      --light-blue: #eaf3f7;
      --background: #f5f8fa;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --text: #293744;
      --muted: #647582;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.7;
      background: var(--background);
      color: var(--text);
    }

    header {
      background: var(--navy);
      color: white;
      padding: 15px 7%;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 15px;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 21px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    nav ul {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 18px;
      list-style: none;
    }

    nav a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: #a9d9eb;
    }

    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #123047, #176b87);
      color: white;
      padding: 75px 7%;
    }

    .hero-content {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: auto;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 45px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .profile {
      width: 190px;
      height: 190px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: center;
      display: block;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      border: 5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.5);
    }

    .hero-text {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 250px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 36px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .hero h2 {
      font-size: 21px;
      font-weight: normal;
      color: #d8edf5;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .hero p {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: white;
      color: var(--navy);
      padding: 10px 22px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin: 5px 8px 5px 0;
    }

    .button:hover {
      background: #d8edf5;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 30px 20px;
    }

    section {
      background: var(--white);
      padding: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      border-radius: 9px;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.05);
      scroll-margin-top: 90px;
    }

    section h2 {
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 25px;
      border-bottom: 3px solid var(--blue);
      padding-bottom: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    h3 {
      color: var(--blue);
      margin-top: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 7px;
    }

    ul {
      padding-left: 23px;
    }

    li {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .publication-list li {
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .publication-list a {
      color: var(--blue);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .publication-list a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .date {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .contact-links a {
      color: var(--blue);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    footer {
      background: var(--navy);
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 25px 15px;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      header {
        position: static;
      }

      nav {
        justify-content: center;
      }

      nav ul {
        justify-content: center;
      }

      .hero {
        padding: 50px 6%;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .hero-content {
        justify-content: center;
      }

      .hero-text {
        min-width: 100%;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 28px;
      }

      section {
        padding: 22px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <!-- NAVIGATION -->
  <header>
    <nav>
      <div class="logo">Dawit Girma Buayu</div>

      <ul>
        <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="#education">Education</a></li>
        <li><a href="#research">Research</a></li>
        <li><a href="#experience">Experience</a></li>
        <li><a href="#publications">Publications</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <!-- HERO SECTION -->
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">

      <img
        src="profile.jpg"
        alt="Dawit Girma Buayu"
        class="profile"
      >

      <div class="hero-text">
        <h1>Dawit Girma Buayu</h1>

        <h2>Lecturer and Researcher in Water Resources Engineering</h2>

        <p>
          Department of Hydraulic and Water Resources Engineering,
          Wolkite University, Ethiopia.
        </p>

        <p>
          M.Sc. in Civil Engineering (Hydraulic Engineering).
          My academic and research interests focus on hydrology,
          water resources management, climate change, groundwater,
          flood risk management, irrigation, GIS and remote sensing.
        </p>

        <a href="#publications" class="button">View Publications</a>

        <a href="#contact" class="button">Contact Me</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <main>

    <!-- ABOUT -->
    <section id="about">
      <h2>About Me</h2>

      <p>
        I am Dawit Girma Buayu, a Lecturer and Researcher at
        Wolkite University, Ethiopia, specializing in Water Resources
        Engineering. I hold an M.Sc. degree in Civil Engineering
        (Hydraulic Engineering) from Addis Ababa University and a
        B.Sc. degree in Hydraulic and Water Resources Engineering
        from Wollega University.
      </p>

      <p>
        I have academic and professional experience in teaching,
        research, engineering design, water supply and irrigation
        projects. My work integrates engineering principles,
        hydrological analysis, geospatial technologies and
        scientific research to address water-related challenges.
      </p>

      <p>
        I am particularly interested in sustainable water resources
        development, climate resilience, hydrological modeling,
        groundwater assessment and the application of emerging
        technologies in water resources planning and management.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- EDUCATION -->
    <section id="education">
      <h2>Educational Background</h2>

      <h3>M.Sc. in Civil Engineering (Hydraulic Engineering)</h3>
      <p>Addis Ababa University, Ethiopia</p>
      <p class="date">2021</p>

      <h3>B.Sc. in Hydraulic and Water Resources Engineering</h3>
      <p>Wollega University, Ethiopia</p>
      <p class="date">2016</p>
    </section>

    <!-- RESEARCH -->
    <section id="research">
      <h2>Research Interests</h2>

      <ul>
        <li>Hydrology and Hydrological Modeling</li>
        <li>Water Resources Management</li>
        <li>Climate Change and Water Resources</li>
        <li>Groundwater Assessment and Management</li>
        <li>Flood Risk Assessment and Management</li>
        <li>Irrigation and Drainage Engineering</li>
        <li>GIS and Remote Sensing Applications</li>
        <li>Applications of Artificial Intelligence in Water Resources Planning and Management</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- ACADEMIC EXPERIENCE -->
    <section id="experience">
      <h2>Academic and Professional Experience</h2>

      <h3>Lecturer and Researcher</h3>
      <p><strong>Wolkite University, Ethiopia</strong></p>
      <p class="date">September 14, 2017 – Present</p>

      <p>
        Teaching and conducting research in the areas of Hydraulic
        and Water Resources Engineering, Civil Engineering, and
        Construction Technology and Management (COTM).
      </p>

      <h3>Part-time Site and Office Engineer</h3>
      <p><strong>GMN Water Works Construction Plc.</strong></p>
      <p class="date">March 01, 2022 – September 13, 2025</p>

      <p>
        Participated in site and office engineering activities
        associated with water supply and irrigation projects,
        including engineering documentation, design review,
        technical calculations, construction supervision and
        project coordination.
      </p>

      <h3>Part-time Site and Office Engineer</h3>
      <p><strong>Etenesh Abebaw WWC</strong></p>
      <p class="date">January 02, 2017 – February 05, 2022</p>

      <p>
        Worked on various water supply and irrigation projects,
        supporting engineering design, office documentation,
        construction activities and site supervision.
      </p>

      <h3>Engineering Skills and Responsibilities</h3>

      <ul>
        <li>Engineering documentation and design review</li>
        <li>AutoCAD drawings and engineering layouts</li>
        <li>Engineering design calculations</li>
        <li>Preparation of Bills of Quantities (BOQ)</li>
        <li>Cost estimation and material take-offs</li>
        <li>Site supervision and quality control</li>
        <li>Construction management and technical problem-solving</li>
        <li>Quantity measurements and project coordination</li>
        <li>Coordination with contractors, subcontractors and suppliers</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

